# State Parity Test (Shadow Replay) — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **Shadow Replay** diagnostic pipeline that records the exact data, features, and model predictions the live bot sees on every 5-minute bar, and allows offline replay to detect whether sim-to-live performance gaps are caused by a **Pipeline Bug** or a **Data Discrepancy**.

